@ddd.aggregate

purpose:
  Consistency boundary.

use_when:
  - multiple entities must change atomically
  - business invariant exists

avoid_when:
  - simple CRUD
  - no consistency boundary required

related:
  @ddd.entity
  @ddd.value-object
  @ddd.repository

why:
  Prevents unrelated objects from participating
  in the same consistency boundary.

State: +